    "source": "package/dist/antd.min.js; runtime CSS-in-JS; React 18.3.1; inherited global-token typography/color; public consumer APIs and ConfigProvider.renderEmpty",
    "operation": "Open each actual public consumer and compare custom scalars/nodes/arrays, falsy OR/default vs Table.filter nullish fallback, local override, nested provider replacement and AutoComplete exclusion",
    "nativeBoundary": "Without renderEmpty, existing native localized text/loading/defaults remain. With renderEmpty, source default simple/small Empty is used after falsy output; Table.filter uses its own localized 24px image. Table empty snippet represents locale.emptyText. Callback scheduling is consumption-driven, except Transfer derives locale at root; React render counts and native popup/table DOM/open state are not compared. Empty native ARIA/paint/responsive contracts remain. Visibility/blank slots normalize to an empty array. Local zero Select/TreeSelect stays visible and is compared against fresh pre-migration library revision 8847e8d rather than source popup suppression.",
    "scope": "Current consumers only; deprecated List cases removed. Retained raw measurements unchanged."
  },
